    *******Deploy the image to cloud server and run it with the following command:***
    Create an Azure VM
       ->Azure Portal → Virtual Machines → Create
         Choose Ubuntu 22.04 LTS
         Size: Standard_B1s
         Allow inbound ports: 22 (SSH), 8096 (App)
         Create username/password
		 Click Review + Create
    SSH Into Azure VM
    	ssh azureuser@<PUBLIC-IP>
    Install Docker on Azure VM
		sudo apt update
		sudo apt install docker.io
		sudo systemctl start docker
		sudo systemctl enable docker	
    Pull Your Image from Docker Hub
        docker login
        docker pull sandipyadav17891/myapp:v1
    Run Your Container on Azure VM
		docker run -p 8096:8096 sandipyadav17891/myapp:v1   
    check if the container is running with the following command:
		docker ps
		
	Run the container with the following command:
